From: David Freeman <david@tinytrashlabs.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 22:15:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 03/12] test(engine): SuperTonic synthesis smoke + preset
 validation

Planner-level tests (run everywhere): unknown/missing speaker throws
speakerRequired before any model load, un-acked synth throws
licenseAckRequired, a valid preset reaches the provider with no clone
or knob values. The real-weights smoke test is gated behind
ENGINEKIT_LIVE_TESTS=1 (+ SUPERTONIC_WEIGHTS_DIR override) because SPM
xctest can't load the MLX metallib from the CLI; the executable path is
covered instead via spike, which gains --model-dir (local weights
override) and a generic needsLicenseAck ack for the selected backend.

Verified live: spike --backend supertonic --speaker M1 --model-dir
.../weights-repo renders 3.27 s of 44.1 kHz audio at 2.54x realtime;
--speaker NOPE fails with speakerRequired before load.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
